<title>USA: C-TEC enters agreement with NYNEX.</title>
<headline>C-TEC enters agreement with NYNEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>RCN, a subsidiary of C-TEC Corp, said on Monday it has entered an interconnection agreement with NYNEX Corp to provide telecommunications services in the state of New York.</p>
<p>This is RCN's first agreement with a Regional Bell Operating Company, RCN said.</p>
